      "raw_mention": "American Eagle",
      "text": "Are Frontier lab relative valuations are too absurd nowadays?\n\nIf Anthropic IPOs at $2T… 10% of that can buy up almost every major established consumer brand:\n\nFrom: \n\nTaco Bell/Pizza Hut/KFC, GAP, American eagle, Levi’s, Victoria’s Secret, Cheesecake Factory, Krispy Kreme…\n\nCalvin Klein, Kohls, AMC, Kura Sushi, Dennys, Nike, Build a Bear, Jack in the Box, IHOP, Papa John’s…\n\nShake Shack, Apple Bees, Dave & Busters, Under Armour, Petco, Canada Goose.\n\nAll together. Using 10% of Anthropic.\n\nAnd they’d still have $51.6B leftover.",
      "url": "https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093265972207718782",
